## Overview

This folder contains practical experiments performed as part of the Medical Photonics course. It includes experiment procedures, observations, calculations, MATLAB programs, output images, graphs, results, and conclusions.

## Contents

- Experiment manuals and procedures
- Step-by-step experiment records
- MATLAB codes and scripts
- Experimental observations and calculations
- Output images, graphs, and plots
- Results and conclusions
- Supporting reference materials

## Organization

Experiments are arranged by experiment number for easy access.

Each experiment may contain:
- Aim
- Required tools and software
- Theory and working principle
- Procedure
- MATLAB code, where applicable
- Observations and outputs
- Result and conclusion

## File Naming Convention

Use the following format:

`Experiment_XX_Experiment_Name`

## Note

All practical work and experiment files will be added and maintained in this folder, with the latest completed work organized first where applicable.
